  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. $\\Omega_{zw}$, $R$ and $x_0$\nAs in the earlier notebooks: $\\Omega_{zw}=e_1^TR$, $R=e^{r_1E_{12}}e^{r_2E_{13}}e^{r_3E_{23}}$ with the rep-independent $r_i(z,w)$; $\\Omega=\\Omega_{zw}\\otimes\\Omega_{zw}$; $x_0=(e_1^TP_{\\rm phys}^{-1})^{\\otimes2}$, used only for $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=1$. Check: $\\Omega$ is a left eigenvector of every $t_a(G')$ with $G'=P_{\\rm aux}G(w)P_{\\rm aux}^{-1}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rOm[zv_, wv_] := {(wv[[1]] - zv[[1]])/(wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[1]]) (zv[[1]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (wv[[2]] - zv[[3]])),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (zv[[3]] - wv[[2]]))};\nRrot[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, nexp[r[[1]] EN[1, 2]] . nexp[r[[2]] EN[1, 3]] . nexp[r[[3]] EN[2, 3]]];\nRrotInv[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, nexp[-r[[3]] EN[2, 3]] . nexp[-r[[2]] EN[1, 3]] . nexp[-r[[1]] EN[1, 2]]];\nOm1[zv_, wv_] := e1 . Rrot[zv, wv];\nOm2[zv_, wv_] := With[{o = Om1[zv, wv]}, kron[o, o]];\nee[i_, j_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, ii] KroneckerDelta[j, jj], {ii, 3}, {jj, 3}];\nGc[tw_] := {{Total[tw], -(tw[[1]] tw[[2]] + tw[[1]] tw[[3]] + tw[[2]] tw[[3]]), Times @@ tw}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nrsSol[zv_] := {s1 -> zv[[1]]^2/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]])), s2 -> -(zv[[2]]/(zv[[1]] (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))), s3 -> 1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]]), ρ1 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[2]]), ρ2 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[1]]), ρ3 -> (zv[[2]]^2 (zv[[3]] - zv[[1]]))/(zv[[1]]^2 (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))};\nPaux[zv_] := (MatrixExp[-ρ1 ee[2, 3]] . MatrixExp[-ρ2 ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[-ρ3 ee[1, 2]] . DiagonalMatrix[1/{s1, s2, s3}] . MatrixExp[-(1/zv[[1]]) ee[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) ee[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[-((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) ee[3, 2]]) /. rsSol[zv];\nPphys[zv_] := With[{q = rsSol[zv]}, nexp[(ρ1 /. q) EN[3, 2]] . nexp[(ρ2 /. q) EN[3, 1]] . nexp[(ρ3 /. q) EN[2, 1]] . DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[({s1, s2, s3}[[k]] /. q)^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]] . nexp[(1/zv[[1]]) EN[1, 2]] . nexp[-(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) EN[1, 3]] . nexp[((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) EN[2, 3]]];\nx0[zv_] := With[{x = e1 . Inverse[Pphys[zv]]}, kron[x, x]];\nzT = N[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, pr]; wT = N[{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, pr];\nGP = Paux[zT] . Gc[wT] . Inverse[Paux[zT]];\n{tO, omTests} = AbsoluteTiming[{maxAbs[Paux[zT] . Gc[zT] . Inverse[Paux[zT]] - DiagonalMatrix[zT]],\n    Table[With[{o = Om2[zT, wT]}, With[{c = o . tL2[a, 2/9, GP]}, maxAbs[c - (c[[1]]/o[[1]]) o]]], {a, 2}],\n    maxAbs[actRR[RrotInv[zT, wT], actRR[Rrot[zT, wT], e11 + Range[d2]]] - (e11 + Range[d2])]}];\nGrid[{{\"P_aux G(z) P_aux^-1 - diag(z)\", omTests[[1]]}, {\"Ω left eigenvector of t_a(G'), a = 1,2 (residuals)\", omTests[[2]]}, {\"(R⊗R)^-1(R⊗R) - 1 (via actRR)\", omTests[[3]]}, {\"time (s)\", tO}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"9\" data-out-n=\"160\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"5\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[160]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.85em;vertical-align:-2.155em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.695em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.655em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.81em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.155em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.655em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.815em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P_aux G(z) P_aux</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-1