      },
      {
       "data": "Out[189]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\lambda  & \\text{f\\_$\\lambda$ (fitted at P1)} & \\text{\\# matching ansatz forms} & \\text{rel. residual of factorized form at P2}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\text{($\\theta$12−}3\\text{h)}\\text{($\\theta$12−}5\\text{h)} & 1 & 0.\\times 10^{-195}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & \\text{($\\theta$12−}2\\text{h)}\\text{($\\theta$12−}3\\text{h)}\\text{($\\theta$12−}4\\text{h)}\\text{($\\theta$12−}5\\text{h)} & 1 & 0.\\times 10^{-194}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3\\right\\} & \\text{($\\theta$12−}1\\text{h)}\\text{($\\theta$12−}2\\text{h)}\\text{($\\theta$12−}3\\text{h)}^2\\text{($\\theta$12−}4\\text{h)}\\text{($\\theta$12−}5\\text{h)} & 1 & 0.\\times 10^{-192}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & \\text{($\\theta$12−}1\\text{h)}^2\\text{($\\theta$12−}2\\text{h)}\\text{($\\theta$12−}3\\text{h)}^2\\text{($\\theta$12−}4\\text{h)}\\text{($\\theta$12−}5\\text{h)} & 1 & 0.\\times 10^{-191}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "2dff419a-9629-4756-b52d-39bb02414a25"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Signal/contamination split and the structural test\nTop-killed covectors $d_\\lambda=c_\\lambda-(c_\\lambda\\cdot e_1e_1)e_1e_1$, with $c_\\lambda=\\langle\\Omega|T_\\lambda(u_{\\rm loc})(R\\otimes R)^{-1}$. For a state $\\Psi$: $S=d\\cdot P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi$ and $K=d\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\Psi_\\perp$ (using $(R\\otimes R)P_{\\rm HW}=P_{\\rm HW}$). The **chain identity** $d\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\Psi=q$ with the Q-side number $q_\\lambda=(T^B_\\lambda-c_\\lambda\\cdot e_1e_1)\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$ is checked, with the eigenvalue $T^B_\\lambda$ from `evT` (no matrix $T_\\lambda$).\n\nThe ratios $k=K/S_{\\rm ref}$ use a fixed reference insertion per state: the one with the largest signal at the base point. They are compared over three direction pairs at $\\varepsilon=10^{-5}$. A spread of $O(\\varepsilon)$ means the contamination is structural.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rawCovs[zv_, wv_] := rawCovs[zv, wv] = With[{g = RrotInv[zv, wv], c0 = Om2[zv, wv], Z = DiagonalMatrix[zv]}, Table[covRR[covT[λ, uLoc, Z, c0], g], {λ, locShapes}]];\ndCovs[zv_, wv_] := (# - (# . e11) e11) & /@ rawCovs[zv, wv];\n(* Q-side numbers: eigenvalue minus the top part, times <Ω|Ψ> *)\nqNums[Ψ_, zv_, wv_] := With[{ΩΨ = Om2[zv, wv] . Ψ, raw = rawCovs[zv, wv]}, Table[(evT[locShapes[[j]], uLoc, Ψ, zv] - raw[[j]] . e11) ΩΨ, {j, nL}]];\nKS[μ_, copy_, ε_, φv_, ωv_] := Module[{zv = zOf[ε, φv], wv = wOf[ε, ωv], Ψ, Ψhw, rest, ds},\n   Ψ = pickState[μ, copy, zv][\"psi\"]; Ψhw = projHW[μ, Ψ]; rest = actRR[Rrot[zv, wv], Ψ - Ψhw]; ds = dCovs[zv, wv];\n   <|\"S\" -> (# . Ψhw & /@ ds), \"K\" -> (# . rest & /@ ds), \"sc\" -> Norm[Ψ] Max[Norm /@ ds], \"psi\" -> Ψ, \"z\" -> zv, \"w\" -> wv|>];\nKSm[μ_, copy_, ε_] := KSm[μ, copy, ε] = KS[μ, copy, ε, φ, ω];\nnonTop = Rest[hwList];\nrefOf[μ_, copy_] := refOf[μ, copy] = Ordering[Abs[KSm[μ, copy, 10^-5][\"S\"]], -1][[1]];\nnormKS[d_, μ_, copy_] := With[{sref = d[\"S\"][[refOf[μ, copy]]]}, {d[\"K\"]/sref, d[\"S\"]/sref}];\n(* chain identity at ε = 10^-4 *)\nchainRes = Max[Table[With[{d = KSm[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], 10^-4]}, Max[Abs[qNums[d[\"psi\"], d[\"z\"], d[\"w\"]] - (d[\"S\"] + d[\"K\"])]]/d[\"sc\"]], {μc, nonTop}]];\ndirs = {{\"φ, ω\", φ, ω}, {\"φ', ω\", φp, ω}, {\"φ, ω'\", φ, {1/9, 5/4, -3/7}}};\n{tSt, struct} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{r = Table[normKS[KS[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], 10^-5, dd[[2]], dd[[3]]], μc[[1]], μc[[2]]], {dd, dirs}]},\n     {μc[[1]], μc[[2]], locShapes[[refOf[μc[[1]], μc[[2]]]]], N[Max[Table[Max[Abs[Flatten[r[[i]] - r[[1]]]]], {i, Length[r]}]], 2], N[Re[Chop[r[[1, 1]], 10^-8]], 5], N[Re[Chop[r[[1, 2]], 10^-8]], 5]}], {μc, nonTop}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"copy\", \"S_ref insertion\", \"spread over directions (ε=10^-5)\", \"k = K_j/S_ref, j = \" <> ToString[locShapes], \"s = S_j/S_ref\"}}, struct,\n   {{\"chain residual (rel., ε=10^-4)\", N[chainRes, 3], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s)\", tSt, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"13\" data-out-n=\"201\" data-sub-idx=\"13\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[201]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:19.28em;vertical-align:-9.37em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:9.91em;\"><span style=\"top:-11.87em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.87em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:19.24em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-9.37em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:9.87em;\"><span style=\"top:-12.03em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.82em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mc